SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 GMT: Youth Music: Recharge Fund\, Racial Equity (up 
 to GBP 120\,000 core funding over four years)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 04 Dec 2026 at 17:00 GMT.\n\nYouth Music's Recharge Fund
 : Racial Equity gives multi-year core funding to creative organisations ac
 ross England that are led by communities who experience racial injustice a
 nd that work with children and/or young people of different ages and backg
 rounds. It is not music-only: organisations can work across a variety of a
 rt forms.\n\nOrganisation: Youth Music\nLocation: England. For creative or
 ganisations led by communities who experience racial injustice and working
  with children and/or young people.\nAward: Core funding of up to GBP 120\
 ,000 over four years per organisation\, from a total pot of GBP 2\,400\,00
 0. No application fee.\nDuration: Four years\; funded programmes start bet
 ween 1 June and 30 September 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.youthmusic.org.uk/
 funding/recharge-fund-racial-equity?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&
 utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.youthmusic.org.uk/funding/recharge-fund-racial-equity?utm_s
 ource=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:England. For creative organisations led by communities who experie
 nce racial injustice and working with children and/or young people.
END:VEVENT
